      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In a randomised, double-blind, cross-over study on 20 healthy human volunteers, the effect of intravenous midazolam on pain tolerance using the 'submaximum effort tourniquet technique' is described. Intravenous midazolam administered in conscious sedation doses was found to significantly reduce the affective and motivational component of the pain experience."},
